---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Eclectic Psychotherapy Training in Nepal: Puzzle Therapy" 
  description="Puzzle Therapy is Nepal Hypnosis's flagship training for aspiring and practising therapists: hypnotherapy, Gestalt, trauma work, counselling, CBT and psychodynamic approaches."
>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F5F1EA] to-white pt-16 pb-12 border-b border-[#e2e8f0]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#D84315] uppercase">Professional Training</span>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] leading-tight">Puzzle Therapy: Becoming an Eclectic Therapist</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
        Puzzle Therapy is our flagship training programme. It is a practice-oriented, modular programme for people who want to become skilled, ethical mental-health practitioners, or to widen the skills they already have.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="py-12 bg-white">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-10 text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-4">What you will learn</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Psychosocial counselling:</strong> the core relationship and communication skills</li>
          <li><strong>Cognitive Behavioural Therapy (CBT):</strong> working with thoughts, emotions and behaviour</li>
          <li><strong>Psychodynamic & Gestalt therapy:</strong> awareness-based, experiential work</li>
          <li><strong>Clinical hypnotherapy & Trauma-informed practice:</strong> safe, ethical use of advanced tools</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-[#173A7A] text-center text-white">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <a href="https://portal.nepalhypnosis.com/form/consultation-request" target="_blank" class="rounded-xl bg-[#D84315] px-8 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-[#b93812] transition">Check availability and enrol</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>